Subject: Cantor Identity Admission Journal Transport P5 Solution

@ [solution_uuid] 0c223be0-0f4e-4f4a-9b21-585d0df7484b

& [ImplementedSolution]
  + the complete AccountableObjectAdmission is a typed journal mutation and inference-facing AdmitObject request
  + the host delegates acceptance to the P4 seven-faculty gate then binds the exact event successor and response
  + the existing durable MCP custody path transports persists restarts and resolves the resulting identity without a bypass

& [Meaning]
  + Cantor now has an objective accounting seam around inference: proposal then Judgment then durable event then explicit handle
  + the seam makes identity continuity inspectable and replayable; it does not turn transformer activations into hidden pointers or prove a proposal true
